1
00:00:03,185 --> 00:00:07,062
Open Interaction Center, Management, Subject Flows.

2
00:00:07,062 --> 00:00:11,891
With no subjects yet, the page asks you to create a content type.

3
00:00:11,891 --> 00:00:16,517
A subject is a content type with the Omnichannel Subject part.

4
00:00:16,517 --> 00:00:19,645
Enter its display name and click Create.

5
00:00:20,096 --> 00:00:25,132
On the Add Parts page, click Add and Configure next to Omnichannel Subject.

6
00:00:25,132 --> 00:00:28,116
The subject's settings open straight away.

7
00:00:28,567 --> 00:00:31,054
Direction is Outbound by default.

8
00:00:31,054 --> 00:00:36,093
Pick a default campaign, used when an activity is created outside a load,

9
00:00:36,093 --> 00:00:37,751
for example by hand.

10
00:00:37,751 --> 00:00:43,427
Require a disposition is on, because the disposition is what runs the subject flow.

11
00:00:43,427 --> 00:00:47,062
Leave it on unless the subject is a one-way notice.

12
00:00:47,062 --> 00:00:48,147
Click Save.

